  "claim_short": "For every compact star-shaped S in R^d, this packet improves the sufficient threshold in Fradelizi-Langi-Zvavitch arXiv:1910.06146 for vol(S[k+1]/(k+1)) >= vol(S[k]/k), with the same equality characterization. The published k >= (d-1)(d-2) is replaced by the exact coefficient condition k >= d-1 and (k-d+2)(k+1)^(d-1) > k^d. In particular k >= binom(d,2)-1 suffices, lowering the asymptotic threshold from d^2 to...",
